<title>USA: Richmond Fed manufacturing, services indexes mixed.</title>
<headline>Richmond Fed manufacturing, services indexes mixed.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of</p>
<p>Richmond said its indexes monitoring manufacturing and</p>
<p>service-sector activity were mixed in November.</p>
<p> MANUFACTURING SURVEY     Nov	     Oct</p>
<p>  Shipments		     0		 4</p>
<p>  New Orders		    5		 2</p>
<p>  Backlog Orders	     -7		-9</p>
<p>  Number of Employees	 6		 1</p>
<p>  Average workweek	   -5		 4</p>
<p>  Prices received	 -0.17	   +0.15</p>
<p>  Prices paid	     +0.27	   +0.35</p>
<p> SERVICES SURVEY	    Nov	     Oct</p>
<p>  Service revenues	    5		17</p>
<p>  Number of Employees	 4		 2</p>
<p>  Service wage		 13		22</p>
<p>  Retail revenues	    38		 7</p>
<p>  Retail employees	   12	     -14</p>
<p>  Retail wage		  18		28</p>
<p>  Shopper traffic	    22	     -11</p>
</text>
